# Onderon, the Iziz spaceport to Captain Riiken (TSL, 501OND, 502OND,
# 512OND): Queen Talia and Master Kavar in the throne room (cs_tal_1),
# Mandalore on Iziz and his doctor friend (501_mand), the port master's
# starport visa (asked about the lockdown, the checkpoints and the visa),
# the beast rider asked about his kind, his boma loose and slain, his
# credits thanked for as not needed (LSP),
# the checkpoint guard answered plainly (no trader's lie, no "powerful
# Jedi": the bounty hunters' leader then has no tale from the guard), the
# Merchant Quarter: the journalist Vaklu's soldiers take for a spy (a
# warrant and proof asked for, then [Persuade]: LSP), the Gran and the
# Twi'lek's politics (the Queen the rightful ruler), Ponlar's crowd
# answered for the Republic (not "The Queen should listen to the will of
# her people": the Queen's side), the Western Square: the thugs after the
# Exile's bounty fought, Dhagon Ghent's office (arrested, ask Riiken),
# the Rodian bounty hunters (Mira defended: +INF) fought; back to Captain
# Riiken by the air defense tower: Dhagon in custody for Captain Sullio's
# murder, how to clear him (docalibi).
# Starts from Dxun's departure checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @onderon_spaceport data/routes/tsl/onderon_spaceport.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Onderon Port", "Iziz Merchant Quarter" and
# "Iziz: Western Square" (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
# Left: Margar's, Gegorran's and 1B-8D's stores, the news holograms, the visa
# beggars (Terlyn and Tolas by the starport gate), Anda (Vaklu's side
# only), Gelesi, Bostuco, Hanharr's starport trigger (not in the party).
#
# ASSUMES:
# - The party is the Exile, Mandalore and Mira (dxun_departure).
# - cs_tal_1 opens the module by itself (k_501_enter, the first
#   entry) and tr_mand_intro by the shuttle starts 501_mand at once:
#   both play as dxun_departure's last fight ends, before its save.
# - the journalist's [Persuade] (R14) passes on the Exile's own
#   Persuade (E14 is gated, E12 is the failure: the journalist is taken,
#   no DSP). With Affect Mind, R19 [Force Persuade] is offered too; the
#   say asks for R14 either way.
# - the politics (al_poli start 0) hub: after the three questions
#   it may end on "I don't want to get involved" (then the Queen line is
#   start 1's, met on a later pass) or run on into start 1's question.
# - Not met: Ponlar's riot (mp_ponla start 2) comes on a second pass by the
#   market; this route passes it once. The escape (onderon_kavar) may meet
#   it: "I won't fight civilians" is the line that keeps out of it.
# - tr_bh1_talk starts the Rodians (bounty1) only on the way back
#   from Dhagon's office (DSimpson: a precognition first, tr_bh_cv).
say There's a lockdown? # the port master (tr_port_master)
say Military checkpoints? Are they looking for something?
say What's a starport visa?
say Can I go now?
to tr_port_master
talk
equip g_w_lghtsbr01  # the saber in hand
say I am no merchant. # the beast rider by his cages (beastrdr)
say Who are you?
say Tell me about the beast-riders.
say I'll be going now.
use beast_rider
talk
say Thank you for the credits, they aren't necessary. # his apology, once
say I'll be going now. # the boma is slain (start 3: LSP, his credits)
to tr_boma_attack    # his boma gets loose as the Exile walks off
talk
fight 20             # the frenzied boma (boma_frenzy)
talk                 # the beast rider's apology, by itself
say My business is my own. # the checkpoint guard (tr_cp_guard)
say My ship has no corporate affiliations.
say No, nothing to sell.
to tr_cp_guard
talk
exit To_502
module 502ond
say Do you have some sort of warrant? # the journalist (intgate)
say Do you have proof of any sort?
say [Persuade] You're violating this man's rights # (LSP)
to tr_interrogate
talk
say What do you think of Queen Talia? # the Gran and the Twi'lek (al_poli)
say I don't know much about General Vaklu.
say There would be deep consequences if Onderon secedes
say Who do you trust more?
say The Queen is Onderon's rightful ruler.
to tr_alien_politic
talk
say Surely the Republic does something in return for you? # Ponlar
to tr_market_mob
talk
exit To_512
module 512ond
talk                 # the bounty thugs' leader (th_lead)
fight 30
say Where is he?     # Dhagon's thug at his office
say Mandalore, could Dhagon have done this?
say What tower?
say Thanks for the information.
say I'm not going to let you insult my companion. # the Rodians (Mira +INF)
to tr_dhagon_office
talk
to tr_bh1_talk       # the Rodian bounty hunters on the way back (bounty1)
talk
fight 30
exit To_502
module 502ond
say Do you have a man named Dhagon Ghent in custody? # Riiken
say Who got murdered?
say How long is Dhagon going to be questioned?
say How can I eliminate him as a suspect? # a_alibi_start
use g_riiken
talk
save onderon_alibi
